building, using, developing, or distributing eCapture and works derived from
eCapture. This permission includes commercial use and redistribution of
eCapture binaries and corresponding source, including modified SDK versions
used with eCapture. Recipients may pass on these same permissions to further
recipients of eCapture. Retain this notice and the SDK copyright notice in
source distributions and include them in binary distribution notices. No
permission is granted for unrelated standalone uses of this SDK. If a term
below conflicts with this exception, this exception controls for the uses
described here.

